WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:20.000
When two products can travel together, they can share one delivery charge. We use safe QA products only.

2
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:40.000
These products can travel together, so they share one delivery charge. In the verified QA story that shared charge is twenty-five point zero zero.

3
00:00:40.000 --> 00:01:00.000
If fulfilment paths are incompatible, the store separates them. Customers may see more than one delivery charge. That is expected when items cannot travel together.
